# Dependencies
node_modules/
# The rule above ends in a slash, so it matches directories only. A workspace
# checkout's node_modules is a SYMLINK, which slipped past it and got committed
# as a self-referential link that breaks `pnpm install` for everyone (PLAT-3252).
node_modules

